00:07:17.470 --> 00:07:19.172
as our transition

00:07:19.172 --> 00:07:21.641
for the new generation of clean energy,

00:07:21.641 --> 00:07:23.075
if you will, in this world.

00:07:23.075 --> 00:07:25.745
Well, Brandon Gibson put

00:07:27.447 --> 00:07:29.148
on our new you get some energy ideas

00:07:29.148 --> 00:07:29.782
in there, Governor.

