00:09:16.522 --> 00:09:18.758
reminds people on a regular basis,

00:09:18.758 --> 00:09:20.493
even in cabinet members that I said

00:09:20.493 --> 00:09:21.360
some pretty mean

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:23.162
and ugly and nasty stuff about him

00:09:23.162 --> 00:09:26.566
which I did we play hardball and

00:09:27.667 --> 00:09:28.734
in our politics

00:09:28.734 --> 00:09:31.103
and but you know I got over it.

00:09:31.103 --> 00:09:31.837
He got over it.

00:09:31.837 --> 00:09:32.805
We work together

00:09:32.805 --> 00:09:34.340
and you know that's

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:36.676
what people need to do in 2024.

00:09:38.611 --> 00:09:40.713
You know I'm still trying to sort that

00:09:40.713 --> 00:09:43.316
out for myself so you know, it

00:09:43.883 --> 00:09:44.884
he may get to hear me

00:09:44.884 --> 00:09:46.953
call him names again. Who knows?

00:09:46.953 --> 00:09:48.921
It's it's still early in the process,

00:09:48.921 --> 00:09:51.824
so I haven't written off that,

00:09:52.692 --> 00:09:52.892
you know,

00:09:52.892 --> 00:09:53.726
if you'll recall,

00:09:53.726 --> 00:09:55.861
I didn't announce for president in

00:09:57.296 --> 00:09:58.965
2011 until August,

00:09:58.965 --> 00:10:01.500
so we got a lot of time left.

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:02.268
Does that mean that you're

00:10:02.268 --> 00:10:03.269
thinking about jumping in

00:10:05.037 --> 00:10:07.239
so I got your attention now, didn't I?

00:10:07.239 --> 00:10:09.275
I think you did.

00:10:09.775 --> 00:10:11.477
I'm not taking any magic mushrooms.

00:10:11.477 --> 00:10:13.746
I can assure you that

00:10:15.481 --> 00:10:16.682
well, you never know.

00:10:16.682 --> 00:10:17.817
You might have some

00:10:17.817 --> 00:10:18.951
traumatic brain injury

00:10:18.951 --> 00:10:19.952
that you don't know about.

00:10:19.952 --> 00:10:22.989
So let's keep an eye on this It's

00:10:22.989 --> 00:10:24.924
something you're thinking about.

00:10:26.192 --> 00:10:28.027
Listen, it's early in the process,

00:10:28.027 --> 00:10:30.229
I think, for any of us to sit back

00:10:30.229 --> 00:10:30.563
and say

00:10:30.563 --> 00:10:32.131
I'm for this person or that person

00:10:32.131 --> 00:10:33.599
is a little early in my process.

00:10:33.599 --> 00:10:35.768
So, you know, it

00:10:35.768 --> 00:10:36.669
certainly is something

00:10:36.669 --> 00:10:39.305
that I haven't taken off the table. But,

00:10:39.305 --> 00:10:40.606
you know, the chances of it

00:10:40.606 --> 00:10:42.975
happening are probably a little bit slim.

00:10:42.975 --> 00:10:43.976
But who knows?

00:10:43.976 --> 00:10:45.144
There's a lot of time left

00:10:45.144 --> 00:10:47.346
and we'll see how this all works out.

00:10:47.847 --> 00:10:48.147
All right.

00:10:48.147 --> 00:10:49.815
Former Texas Governor Rick Perry,

00:10:49.815 --> 00:10:50.650
thanks so much for your time.

